  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77ed7ba528417fe8",
      "translationZh": "为 Amazon Bedrock 的 Mantle 端点向 Claude 应用网关添加了 mantle 上游提供商",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e738fb95d6cd9ee",
      "translationZh": "修复了当轮次提前结束时，SDK 会话会丢失延迟工具调用或已完成工具结果的问题，并修复了 worker 重启后保留的审批提示以及非流式回退模式的 result.usage 问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be3a0b5b3d373cf6",
      "translationZh": "修复了长时运行的工具调用移至后台后，MCP 进度通知被丢弃的问题；现在后台任务会显示最新的进度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78d3c98d06b4433c",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 stdio MCP 服务器在启动过程中会话结束时，导致服务器仍处于运行状态的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "883ea5552ad14a19",
      "translationZh": "修复了无状态远程 MCP 服务器（例如重新部署中的代理）产生的短暂 HTTP 404 错误，导致该服务器在会话剩余时间内虽显示为已连接但无法使用的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb93fcff1a74bfd2",
      "translationZh": "修复了没有有效 URL 的服务器在进行 MCP 登录时会触发模糊 SDK 错误的问题；/mcp 不再为这类服务器提供身份验证选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35953be1313b1d8f",
      "translationZh": "修复了在禁用遥测时，每周 Fable 限制未显示在 /usage 和 VS Code 使用量计表中的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3940f4794189705c",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 plain id 被拒绝的情况下，当 id 带有日期或 -v1:0 后缀时，/model 仍能接受带有 [1m] 的 Sonnet 4.6 或 Sonnet 5 的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8499ea83da7f992",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL 固定为不同模型时，/model 选择器仍显示硬编码的 Haiku 版本和价格的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f6e8968fadd8230",
      "translationZh": "修复了在模型回退期间启动的动态工作流会在回退模型上运行每个代理，而不是重试配置模型的错误",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7cc6c87e7c3f8e8",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 Haiku 是会话的主要模型时，DISABLE_PROMPT_CACHING_HAIKU 不生效的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be7028da5f719c77",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude plugin validate 会认为 Claude Code 接受了其无法安装的插件或市场名称的问题；现在 marketplace.json 中的此类名称将无法通过验证",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dff98eb6923e84c7",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude plugin validate 会通过那些 outputStyles、themes、monitors 或 lspServers 路径缺失或指向插件目录之外的插件的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba0efb97084b33ac",
      "translationZh": "修复了对于在 plugin.json 中声明了其服务器的插件，claude plugin details 会显示 0 个 MCP 服务器的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "125e3d33be0369c0",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude plugin marketplace remove 未说明通过市场卸载了哪些已安装插件的问题；现在它会列出这些插件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50a46bf277575d76",
      "translationZh": "修复了当被命名的插件在该作用域下没有 enabledPlugins 条目时，claude plugin uninstall 会连同其选项和密钥一起删除另一个仅在大小写上有所不同的已安装插件的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
